  "reason": "The only completed run is RNA-only PCA single-profile, with modest accuracy and F1, so it is still unknown whether using multiple profiles adds useful signal. config_002 keeps the same RNA encoder and modality while testing multiprofile with simple average pooling, isolating the profile/aggregation effect. This is the best next budget use because it is a minimal, controlled extension of the baseline and will clarify whether multiprofile aggregation is worth pursuing before testing transformers, other encoders, or multimodal fusion."
